OL,3,GNEWSADates announced for Frankfurt
OL,4,AChristmas Market - and one big change
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe dates have been announced for
OL,7,FBirmingham's Frankfurt Christmas Market
OL,8,F- with organisers also revealing the
OL,9,Flayout will be different this year.
OL,11,FThe market will run for seven weeks,
OL,12,Fopening on 5 November to Christmas Eve.
OL,14,FBut for 2026, there will no stalls
OL,15,Fbetween Nandos and the Apple store on
OL,16,FNew Street due to ongoing roadworks on
OL,17,FBennetts Hill and Temple Street.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
