OL,3,GNEWSADates announced for Frankfurt
OL,4,AChristmas Market - and one big change
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe event is the largest authentic
OL,7,Fmarket of its kind outside of Germany
OL,8,For Austria and will feature traditional
OL,9,Ffood and drink stalls including
OL,10,Fschnitzel, bratwurst, alongside
OL,11,Fhandcrafted gifts, decorations and
OL,12,Fjewellery.
